{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1536647-dtf-killing-earthbounds","id":1536647,"title":"DTF: Killing Earthbounds","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2024-05-31T14:59:47-07:00","id":1536647,"title":"DTF: Killing Earthbounds","content":"Hello. <br /> <br /> I know if you destroy a reliquary the earthbound's spirit manifests for 1 turn before being sucked back to the abyss. In that turn it is vulnerable and can be consumed by another Demon, but is it possible to kill it in any other way? I cant find any reference to that.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5394-argonot","name":"Argonot","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5394_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"227"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-05-31T19:00:09-07:00","id":1536656,"title":"","content":"By RAW it can't be killed. But neither can any other Demon.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>#NothingAboutUsWithoutUs<br /> #AutismPride<br /> She/her pronouns","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5826-monteparnas","name":"monteparnas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5826_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6710"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-06-02T09:48:06-07:00","id":1536700,"title":"","content":"Not an easy task...<br /> &quot;Starve&quot; it out first of all; target its cult, since an Earthbound needs its source of Faith to sustain it, so in theory, killing of their Cult could (empahsis on the could part) force an Earthbound to sink back into its maddened slumber, waiting for the day when it would rise again...<br /> But even in the 21st century, it could be difficult, Humanity's Faith may have dwindled but still enough around, not to mention day by day - depending of your setting of course - the Sebettu preform miracles left and right and Lucifer apearing over Los Angeles in his terrible glory possibly recindled that old flame. At the moment <b>2.4 billion people</b> are christians (give or take a few million) and even if they never were that faithfull that &quot;evidance&quot; they were right porbably sent a tidal wave of Faith around the world - not unlike the Resurgence of Changeling the Dreaming<br /> On July 21, 1969 millions of people across the globe saw, on their televisions, astronauts land on the moon. Glamour rocked the world as it was released from confinement with the return of Wonder to so many people simultaneously. From science came forth magic, if only for a moment. That moment was enough to open Arcadia's gates and the sidhe returned to a world <br /> I belive Lucifer himself manifesting in a fiery vision above the Devil's Nights riots, in live telvison (I could be wrong on the TV part, but I think there were cameras) could had the same effect<br /> So starving it out may not work... - a slumbering low on fuel Earthbound as a snack for a Demon still a problem<br /> <br /> The second and sure way?<br /> Find the Earthbound's True Name - it is particularly an impossible task but the True Name of a being is both its existence, its history and its identity, and in the Demon's case, it was granted directly from God, that often describe their original purpose in creation (and soemthing that changed a bit over the enons)<br /> Armed with a True Name and powerfull magic or Ritual, in theory? You can destroy anything <br /> <br /> The third is a bit murky, but in the Time of Judgement Scenarios Belial manage to craft a weapon that could kill Lucifer <br /> And anything that could kill Him? I would say would kill an Earthbound too","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23890-shadeprowler","name":"Shadeprowler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23890_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"928"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-06-02T13:44:18-07:00","id":1536712,"title":"","content":"Starving a Demon of Faith doesn't kill them. They need Faith to make their magic, not to exist.<br /> <br /> Unless you house rule some specific ritual or spell that does this, a True Name doesn't work either. Demon has extensive rules about their True Names and what can be done to them with it, but it is crystal clear that destroying one of them is out of the table. They even enslave one another with True Names, but it offers no aid at all in the act of actually killing each other.<br /> <br /> Only the idea of some exceedingly specific and ultra rare weapon or ritual doing the trick has some merit, but even then it boils down to something like the ultimate Magnum Opus of one of the five most powerful Earthbound, after a long time of toil, and even then only in theory.<br /> <br /> Being unkillable outside cannibalism is one of the main staples of the splat. They're the hands of the Creator and only the Creator has the real power to undo them.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>#NothingAboutUsWithoutUs<br /> #AutismPride<br /> She/her pronouns","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5826-monteparnas","name":"monteparnas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5826_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6710"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-06-02T18:50:16-07:00","id":1536725,"title":"","content":"I know I've read somewhere about one of the Archdukes being &quot;killed,&quot; sent back to the Abyss, and eventually summoned into a new reliquary again. Given the kind of power and effort it would take to accomplish that, I'm going to assume that if a more permanent means of disposal existed it would have been used by the responsible parties.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3505-matt-the-bruins-fan","name":"Matt the Bruins fan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3505_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2401"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-06-02T23:10:06-07:00","id":1536733,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>monteparnas</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1536647-dtf-killing-earthbounds?p=1536712#post1536712\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Starving a Demon of Faith doesn't kill them. They need Faith to make their magic, not to exist..</div> </div> </div> </div>Okay, I'm not sure you even read what I wrote, or just saw a trigger word and jumped in to argue<br /> As I said ,&quot;starving out&quot; is probably essential, to cut of his power supply, to force him maybe back to slumber - like how Lucifer originaly tried to beat them - , so in a very weakened state it could be devoured - but even then it is a monumental task, and more likely than not, corrupt the Sebettu to the point of no return<br /> But as I said, that methond might not even work, because of the potential lingering &quot;ambient Faith&quot; that is rising thanks to the stunt Lucufer pulled over Los Angeles...<br /> As for the True Name, yes, Demons can't kill each other with it<br /> They can't even summon each other with it, to save from the Abyss, Demons needs Humans, who may potentially could do it - the whole divine spark, Ascension like reach Humanity true potential what Lucifer tried with the Babel Project - and no mater the setting, Ture Name and Magic is a deadly combination<br /> But it is just as likely you find an Earthbound's True Name (or human magician who you trust enough to give it to him) as drying out the Ocean in a week with a leaky thimble<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23890-shadeprowler","name":"Shadeprowler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23890_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"928"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-06-03T17:04:00-07:00","id":1536768,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Shadeprowler</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1536647-dtf-killing-earthbounds?p=1536733#post1536733\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Okay, I'm not sure you even read what I wrote, or just saw a trigger word and jumped in to argue<br /></div> </div> </div> </div>I'm not sure if you read the actual opening post, or just saw the thread name and jumped in to write.<br /> <br /> My argument came from assuming you were answering the actual question, which was if there was another means to kill an Earthbound, other than consuming it.<br /> <br /> The question isn't about the best way to weaken an Earthbound or to set up the consumption, it is about killing it another way, and you seemed to be trying to give an answer, not proposing another approach.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>#NothingAboutUsWithoutUs<br /> #AutismPride<br /> She/her pronouns","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5826-monteparnas","name":"monteparnas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5826_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6710"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-06-04T08:01:56-07:00","id":1536800,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>monteparnas</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1536647-dtf-killing-earthbounds?p=1536712#post1536712\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Being unkillable outside cannibalism is one of the main staples of the splat. They're the hands of the Creator and only the Creator has the real power to undo them.</div> </div> </div> </div>Well, it's not something that can be done by implementing strict Demon RAW, and no doubt quite a feat, but I wouldn't say it's THAT unthinkable<br /> <br /> In p.51 of the core it's said that Caine's atrocious act &quot;inspired&quot; the idea of killing among the Elohim and this happened: Lirael, overlord of the fallen Sixth House, the Angel of Fury, killed the angel Jabniel &quot;he only raised his migthy axe and brought it down on Sagun's defender. As it cut througth Jabniel's presence...<b>the sound it made hissed at Jabniel's true name and in an instant he was no more. Jabniel became the first true casualty that unleashed the Time of Atrocities, his name no longer echoed by Creation</b>&quot;<br /> <br /> That does sound a lot more like &quot;undoing&quot; than &quot;consuming&quot; to me, unless I'm missing something. <br /> <br /> A momentous happening, at the hands of an Angel (they weren't Demons back then before the Abyss), and a high ranking one. There's no reason to think it's a feat anyone can replicate on the modern era. But, still, not quite as impossible as to require the Creator.<br /> <br /> Because of that, I think a ritual or power directly targeting the True Name it's the one &quot;Lore appropriate&quot; way to do it in my opinion. ST discretion, of course.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1683-aleph","name":"Aleph","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1683_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3056"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-06-04T15:36:16-07:00","id":1536812,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Aleph</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1536647-dtf-killing-earthbounds?p=1536800#post1536800\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Well, it's not something that can be done by implementing strict Demon RAW, and no doubt quite a feat, but I wouldn't say it's THAT unthinkable</div> </div> </div> </div>I stand corrected, partially at least.<br /> <br /> They're unkillable outside cannibalism by RAW, and are still exceedingly hard to kill by lore, but while there's a lot unsaid in this excerpt, we do have at least one occurrence of weapon-based angel murder.<br /> <br /> What would took to repeat the feat is anyone's guessing. We don't know even as little as how reliable the narrator was, nor what properties that weapon had, and so on.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>#NothingAboutUsWithoutUs<br /> #AutismPride<br /> She/her pronouns","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5826-monteparnas","name":"monteparnas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5826_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6710"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}